<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>새마을금고 재무 및 경영건전성 분석 시스템</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');
        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100%;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            height: 320px;
            max-height: 400px;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .chart-container {
                height: 350px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl text-white shadow">
                    MG
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">새마을금고 경영건전성 및 재무 보고서</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">전국 주요 금고 재무제표 및 리스크 분석 대시보드</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Search Bar -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 w-full md:w-auto">
                <div class="relative flex-1 md:w-80">
                    <input type="text" id="geumgoSearchInput" value="삼성전자새마을금고" placeholder="금고명을 입력하세요 (예: 삼성전자)" 
                        class="w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-lg border border-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent placeholder-slate-400">
                    <span class="absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-slate-400 text-sm">🔍</span>
                </div>
                <button id="searchBtn" onclick="handleSearch()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg shadow transition">
                    조회
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 space-y-8">

        <!-- Quick Select Preset Badges -->
        <section class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 mr-2">빠른 금고 선택:</span>
            <button onclick="loadGeumgoData('sec')" class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full border bg-blue-50 border-blue-200 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 transition shadow-sm">
                🏢 삼성전자새마을금고 (추천/전국1위)
            </button>
            <button onclick="loadGeumgoData('hyundai')" class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full border bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">
                🚗 현대자동차새마을금고
            </button>
            <button onclick="loadGeumgoData('average')" class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full border bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">
                📊 전국 새마을금고 평균
            </button>
            <button onclick="loadGeumgoData('local_a')" class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-full border bg-white border-slate-300 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">
                🏛️ 일반 지역새마을금고 (샘플 A)
            </button>
        </section>

        <!-- Dynamic Header Banner for Selected Geumgo -->
        <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-blue-950 to-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                        <span id="badgeCategory" class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">
                            초우량 직장금고
                        </span>
                        <span id="badgeIso" class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">
                            ISO 37001 인증
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">2025-2026 공시 기준</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 id="targetTitle" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
                        삼성전자새마을금고
                    </h2>
                    <p id="targetDescription" class="text-slate-300 text-sm mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                        삼성전자 임직원 전용 직장금고로서, 고신용 가계대출 중심의 안정적 자산 운용과 부동산 PF 노출 Zero 구조를 통해 시중은행을 뛰어넘는 압도적 자산 건전성을 유지하고 있습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex md:flex-col items-end justify-between border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-slate-700 pt-4 md:pt-0 md:pl-8 gap-4 min-w-[200px]">
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">자산 규모 순위</div>
                        <div id="targetRank" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-amber-400">전국 1위 (초우량)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">부동산 PF 대출 위험</div>
                        <div id="targetPfRisk" class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">0.00% (위험요인 없음)</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- KPI Scorecard Section -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
            <!-- KPI 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
                    <span>총자산 규모</span>
                    <span class="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">규모 지표</span>
                </div>
                <div id="kpiAsset" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">7조 8,042억</div>
                <p id="kpiAssetSub" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
                    전국 평균(2,292억) 대비 <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">34.0배</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- KPI 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
                    <span>연체율 (연체대출금)</span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">건전성 최우수</span>
                </div>
                <div id="kpiDelinquency" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 tracking-tight">0.01%</div>
                <p id="kpiDelinquencySub" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
                    전국 평균(5.08%) 대비 <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">-5.07%p</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- KPI 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
                    <span>고정이하여신비율 (부실채권)</span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">리스크 0% 수렴</span>
                </div>
                <div id="kpiNpl" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">0.001% 이하</div>
                <p id="kpiNplSub" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
                    시중은행 평균(0.3%) 대비 <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">극도로 양호</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- KPI 4 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-md transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
                    <span>당기순이익 / 영업수익</span>
                    <span class="text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">흑자 경영</span>
                </div>
                <div id="kpiProfit" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">238억 원</div>
                <p id="kpiProfitSub" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
                    영업수익 <span class="text-slate-800 font-semibold">2,794억 원</span> 기반
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Detailed Charts Grid -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            
            <!-- Chart Container 1: Asset Scale Comparison -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">전국 새마을금고 자산 규모 비교</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">단위: 억 원</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        삼성전자새마을금고는 약 7.8조 원의 자산을 보유하여 전국 1,200여 개 금고 중 압도적 1위를 기록하고 있으며, 전국 평균 대비 30배 이상의 자본력을 자랑합니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="assetChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart Container 2: Delinquency Rate & Soundness Benchmark -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">경영건전성 지표 비교 (연체율 vs 부실채권)</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">단위: %</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        최근 부동산 PF 및 경기 침체로 전국 새마을금고 평균 연체율이 5.08%로 상승한 반면, 삼성전자금고는 0.01%라는 사실상 무연체 상태를 유지하고 있습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="soundnessChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart Container 3: Loan Portfolio Structure -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">대출 자산 구성 및 리스크 분석</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">구성비 (%)</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        대출 자산의 97.94%(약 4.53조 원)가 삼성전자 임직원 급여 담보 및 신용대출로 이루어져 있으며, 부실 위험이 높은 기업 PF 대출 노출이 없어 극도로 안정적입니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="portfolioChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart Container 4: Financial Performance Overview -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">수익성 및 성과 지표 (영업수익 & 순이익)</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">단위: 억 원</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        금융권 대손충당금 적립 부담 및 상환 리스크 속에서도 2,790억 원대의 영업수익과 238억 원의 당기순이익을 달성하며 튼튼한 수익성을 증명했습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="profitChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Qualitative Mechanism & Safety Flow Section -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
            <div class="mb-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">삼성전자새마을금고 "무풍지대" 선순환 자금 메커니즘</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
                    외부 거시경제 충격 및 부동산 시장 침체에 영향을 받지 않는 특수 직장금고의 핵심 선순환 구조입니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 relative">
                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">1</div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">초우량 고객군 확보</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                            삼성전자 임직원 전용 금고로 상환 능력이 완벽히 입증된 우수한 수신 및 여신 기반 확보
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600">
                        급여 이체 및 성과급 유입
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">2</div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">가계 중심 안전 대출</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                            전체 대출의 97.94%가 가계자금대출(4.53조 원)로 구성, 위험 부동산 PF 원천 차단
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600">
                        PF 부실 리스크 0%
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">3</div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">초저연체율 실현</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                            연체율 0.01%, 부실채권(고정이하) 0.001% 이하로 시중은행(0.3%)보다 우수한 건전성
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">
                        대손충당금 부담 최소화
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 4 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">4</div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">지속가능 흑자 & ESG</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                            당기순이익 238억 원 달성 및 ISO 37001(부패방지경영) 인증을 통한 투명 경영 체계 구축
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">
                        자산 8조 원 돌파 임박
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Tabular Benchmark & Detailed Data -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-200 gap-2">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">기관별 재무 및 건전성 정밀 비교표</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">삼성전자새마을금고 vs 상위 직장금고 vs 전국 새마을금고 평균 vs 시중은행 평균</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium self-start sm:self-auto">
                    공시데이터 기반
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-4">
                <table class="w-full text-left text-sm border-collapse">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-slate-200">
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">구분 / 평가 항목</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-blue-700 bg-blue-50/50">삼성전자새마을금고</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">현대자동차새마을금고</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">전국 새마을금고 평균</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">시중은행 평균</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-800">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">총자산 규모</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/30">7조 8,042억 원</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4">약 2조 1,000억 원</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500">2,292억 원</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-500">약 300조 원</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">연체율 (연체대출금비율)</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-600 bg-blue-50/30">0.01%</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-emerald-600">0.08%</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-rose-600 font-semibold">5.08%</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-600">약 0.30%</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50">
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">고정이하여신비율 (부실채권)</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-600 bg-blue-50/30">0.001% 이하</td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-emerald-600">0.02%</td>
